{"schema":"s10y-choice-draft-v1","questions":[{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列 $(x_n)$ 的首项为 $x_1$，公比为 $q$。以下哪一组公式依次表示 $x_5,x_{21},x_{150},x_m,x_{m+2},x_{2k+1}$？各下标均为有效项序号。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(x_1q^5,\\ x_1q^{21},\\ x_1q^{150},\\ x_1q^m,\\ x_1q^{m+2},\\ x_1q^{2k+1})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(x_1q^4,\\ x_1q^{20},\\ x_1q^{149},\\ x_1q^{m-1},\\ x_1q^{m+1},\\ x_1q^{2k})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(x_1q^8,\\ x_1q^{40},\\ x_1q^{298},\\ x_1q^{2m-2},\\ x_1q^{2m+2},\\ x_1q^{4k})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(x_1+4q,\\ x_1+20q,\\ x_1+149q,\\ x_1+(m-1)q,\\ x_1+(m+1)q,\\ x_1+2kq)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列 $(u_n)$ 中，$u_1=256$，$q=\\frac12$。以下哪一组依次给出 $u_3,u_5,u_{10},u_n$？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(32,\\ 8,\\ \\frac14,\\ 256(\\frac12)^n)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(128,\\ 32,\\ 1,\\ 256(\\frac12)^{n-2})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(1024,\\ 4096,\\ 131072,\\ 256\\cdot2^{n-1})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(64,\\ 16,\\ \\frac12,\\ 256(\\frac12)^{n-1})$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"四个等比数列的首项、公比、所求项序号分别为：\n\n| 数列 | 首项 | 公比 | 项序号 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| A | $96$ | $\\frac12$ | $7$ |\n| B | $0.125$ | $-2$ | $6$ |\n| C | $4\\sqrt2$ | $-\\frac1{\\sqrt2}$ | $9$ |\n| D | $0.003$ | $\\sqrt{10}$ | $7$ |\n\n按 A、B、C、D 的顺序，所求项组成哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(\\frac32,\\ -4,\\ \\frac{\\sqrt2}{4},\\ 3)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(\\frac34,\\ 8,\\ -\\frac14,\\ 3\\sqrt{10})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(\\frac32,\\ 4,\\ \\frac{\\sqrt2}{4},\\ 3)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(3,\\ 2,\\ -\\frac12,\\ 0.3\\sqrt{10})$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"四个数列分别满足：A：$b_1=3,\\ b_{n+1}=2b_n$；B：$b_1=4,\\ b_{n+1}=-3b_n$；C：$b_1=25,\\ b_{n+1}=5b_n$；D：$b_1=12,\\ b_{n+1}=\\frac12b_n$。按 A、B、C、D 的顺序，哪一组是它们的通项公式？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(3\\cdot2^n,\\ 4(-3)^n,\\ 25\\cdot5^n,\\ 12(\\frac12)^n)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(3+2(n-1),\\ 4-3(n-1),\\ 25+5(n-1),\\ 12+\\frac{n-1}{2})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(3\\cdot2^{n-1},\\ 4(-3)^{n-1},\\ 25\\cdot5^{n-1},\\ 12(\\frac12)^{n-1})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(3\\cdot2^{n-1},\\ -4\\cdot3^{n-1},\\ 25\\cdot5^{n-1},\\ 12(\\frac12)^{n-1})$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"三个数列分别由 $u_n=2^n$、$v_n=5\\cdot3^n$、$w_n=3\\cdot2^{n+1}$ 给出。哪一组论证能证明这三个数列都是等比数列？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"对任意 $n\\ge1$，$\\frac{u_{n+1}}{u_n}=4$，$\\frac{v_{n+1}}{v_n}=9$，$\\frac{w_{n+1}}{w_n}=4$；各比值不依赖 $n$，故三个数列都是等比数列。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"对任意 $n\\ge1$，$\\frac{u_{n+1}}{u_n}=2$，$\\frac{v_{n+1}}{v_n}=15$，$\\frac{w_{n+1}}{w_n}=6$；各比值不依赖 $n$，故三个数列都是等比数列。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"对任意 $n\\ge1$，$\\frac{u_{n+1}}{u_n}=2$，$\\frac{v_{n+1}}{v_n}=3$，$\\frac{w_{n+1}}{w_n}=2$；各比值不依赖 $n$，故三个数列都是等比数列。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"对任意 $n\\ge1$，$\\frac{u_{n+1}}{u_n}=\\frac12$，$\\frac{v_{n+1}}{v_n}=\\frac13$，$\\frac{w_{n+1}}{w_n}=\\frac12$；各比值不依赖 $n$，故三个数列都是等比数列。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列 A 中，第 $8$ 项是 $384$，公比是 $2$；等比数列 B 中，第 $6$ 项是 $\\frac{32}{81}$，公比是 $-\\frac23$。按 A、B 的顺序，它们的首项是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(3,\\ 3)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(3,\\ -3)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(6,\\ 2)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(\\frac32,\\ \\frac92)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列 $(a_n)$ 的第 $5$ 项为 $a_5$，公比为 $q$。哪一组依次表示 $a_7,a_{16},a_{40}$？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(a_5q^6,\\ a_5q^{15},\\ a_5q^{39})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(a_5q^3,\\ a_5q^{12},\\ a_5q^{36})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(a_5+2q,\\ a_5+11q,\\ a_5+35q)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(a_5q^2,\\ a_5q^{11},\\ a_5q^{35})$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"四个等比数列分别满足：A：$b_1=2,b_8=256$；B：$b_1=5,b_9=1280$；C：$b_6=25,b_8=9$；D：$b_4=2,b_7=-54$。按 A、B、C、D 的顺序，哪一组给出了各数列公比的全部实数取值？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(\\{2\\},\\ \\{2\\},\\ \\{\\frac35\\},\\ \\{-3\\})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(\\{-2,2\\},\\ \\{-2,2\\},\\ \\{-\\frac35,\\frac35\\},\\ \\{-3,3\\})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(\\{2\\},\\ \\{-2,2\\},\\ \\{-\\frac9{25},\\frac9{25}\\},\\ \\{-3\\})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(\\{2\\},\\ \\{-2,2\\},\\ \\{-\\frac35,\\frac35\\},\\ \\{-3\\})$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"一个等比数列的第 $8$ 项为 $13$，公比为 $-3$。按第 $10$ 项、第 $13$ 项的顺序，所求结果是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(117,\\ 3159)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(7,\\ -2)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(117,\\ -3159)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(-351,\\ 9477)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列 $(c_n)$ 中，$c_5=27$，$c_4=9$。$c_8$ 等于多少？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$243$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$729$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$1$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$81$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"四个等比数列的首项、公比和某一项的值分别如下：\n\n| 数列 | 首项 | 公比 | 某一项的值 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| A | $2$ | $3$ | $162$ |\n| B | $640$ | $\\frac12$ | $10$ |\n| C | $1$ | $\\frac13$ | $\\frac1{81}$ |\n| D | $2$ | $0.1$ | $0.002$ |\n\n按 A、B、C、D 的顺序，这些项的序号组成哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(4,\\ 6,\\ 4,\\ 3)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(6,\\ 8,\\ 6,\\ 5)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(5,\\ 7,\\ 5,\\ 4)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(5,\\ 6,\\ 5,\\ 4)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"在 $1$ 和 $16$ 之间依次插入三个数，使这五个数按原顺序构成等比数列。哪些有序三元组可以作为插入的三个数？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(-2,\\ 4,\\ -8)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(4,\\ 16,\\ 64)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(2,\\ 4,\\ 8)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(\\frac{19}{4},\\ \\frac{17}{2},\\ \\frac{49}{4})$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"在 $60$ 和 $\\frac{15}{16}$ 之间依次插入五个数，使这七个数按原顺序构成等比数列。哪些有序五元组可以作为插入的五个数？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(-30,\\ -15,\\ -\\frac{15}{2},\\ -\\frac{15}{4},\\ -\\frac{15}{8})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(30,\\ 15,\\ \\frac{15}{2},\\ \\frac{15}{4},\\ \\frac{15}{8})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(120,\\ 240,\\ 480,\\ 960,\\ 1920)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(-30,\\ 15,\\ -\\frac{15}{2},\\ \\frac{15}{4},\\ -\\frac{15}{8})$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列 A 从 $0.1,0.3,\\ldots$ 开始，等比数列 B 从 $1280,640,\\ldots$ 开始。A 中等于 $218.7$ 的项和 B 中等于 $20$ 的项，其序号依次是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(7,\\ 6)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(8,\\ 7)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(9,\\ 8)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(8,\\ 6)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"在银行存入 $1000$ 美元，每年按年利率 $2\\%$ 计息一次，利息并入本金。存满 $4$ 年后，存款本利和的精确金额是哪一个？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$1000(1+4\\cdot0.02)$ 美元","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$1000(1.02)^5$ 美元","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$1000(1.02)^4$ 美元","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$1000(1.02)^3$ 美元","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"一种细菌在营养环境中，每过半小时，每个细菌分裂成两个。从一个细菌开始，经过 $10$ 小时后共有多少个细菌？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$1024$ 个","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$524288$ 个","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$40$ 个","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$1048576$ 个","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"一片试验森林的木材数量每年增长 $10\\%$，最初为 $20\\times10^4\\,\\mathrm{m}^3$。经过 $6$ 年后，木材数量是多少？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$354312.2\\,\\mathrm{m}^3$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$320000\\,\\mathrm{m}^3$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$322102\\,\\mathrm{m}^3$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$389743.42\\,\\mathrm{m}^3$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"在原式有定义的条件下，化简下列两个式子：\n\n$A=\\left(-\\frac{16x^{4n+7}}{y^3}\\right)\\div\\left(\\frac{8x^{3n+5}}{y^2}\\right)$；\n\n$B=\\left(\\frac{81a^{4n-1}}{25}\\right)^3\\cdot\\left(\\frac5{27a^{3n-1}}\\right)^4$。\n\n按 A、B 的顺序，哪一组给出与原式相等的化简结果？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(-\\frac{2x^{7n+12}}{y},\\ \\frac{a^{24n-7}}{25})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(-2x^{n+2}y,\\ 25a)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(-\\frac{2x^{n+2}}{y},\\ \\frac a{25})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(-\\frac{2x^{n+2}}{y},\\ \\frac1{25a})$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"把 $4^n-4^{n-2}$ 和 $9^n-3^{2n-1}$ 分解因式。按这两个式子的顺序，哪一组恒等式成立？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(4^n-4^{n-2},\\ 9^n-3^{2n-1})=(16,\\ 3)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(4^n-4^{n-2},\\ 9^n-3^{2n-1})=(15\\cdot4^{n-1},\\ 2\\cdot3^{2n-1})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(4^n-4^{n-2},\\ 9^n-3^{2n-1})=(15\\cdot4^{n-2},\\ 8\\cdot3^{2n-1})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(4^n-4^{n-2},\\ 9^n-3^{2n-1})=(15\\cdot4^{n-2},\\ 2\\cdot3^{2n-1})$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"约分 $\\frac{9^n-7\\cdot9^{n-1}}8$ 和 $\\frac{3^{2n+1}-3^{2n-1}}{4\\cdot3^n}$。按这两个式子的顺序，哪一组给出了相等的简化结果？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(\\frac{9^{n-1}}4,\\ 2\\cdot3^{n+1})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(\\frac{9^{n-1}}4,\\ 2\\cdot3^{n-1})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(\\frac{9^n}4,\\ 2\\cdot3^{n-1})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(\\frac{9^{n-1}}4,\\ \\frac{3^{n-1}}2)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"函数 $y=4x^2-5x+7$ 中，按 $y=3$、$y=6$ 的顺序，哪些集合给出了对应的全部实数 $x$ 值？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(\\varnothing,\\ \\{\\frac14,1\\})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(\\{\\frac{5-\\sqrt{39}}8,\\frac{5+\\sqrt{39}}8\\},\\ \\{\\frac14,1\\})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(\\varnothing,\\ \\{1\\})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(\\varnothing,\\ \\{\\frac{5-\\sqrt{41}}8,\\frac{5+\\sqrt{41}}8\\})$","figure_ids":[]}]}}],"new_figures":[]}
